  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A wave travels from a liquid to vacuum. The wavefronts are shown on the diagram. The refractive index of the liquid is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\left ( nsin30^{\\circ} \\right )\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\left ( nsin60^{\\circ} \\right )\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\left ( \\frac{sin30^{\\circ}}{n} \\right )\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\left ( \\frac{sin60^{\\circ}}{n} \\right )\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
